28, C5a, and TGF-\u03b2 are less relevant to the acute allergic response seen in this patient. Thus, the refined conclusion is that IL-4 is the most likely to be increased in this patient, reflecting the underlying immunological mechanisms at play in ABPA. \n"], "raw_output": "'''Option: E'''"}
